# The 3DS port, stage 3.6: a run of effect sprites (EspCommonTrans, the ordering table's kind-8 entries one after
# another) leaves out the GX calls whose arguments the sprite before set (blend mode, TEV stage 0 and channel, material
# colour, current matrix), and a sprite without lighting loads no normal matrix. re4_esp_state / RE4_ESP_STATE:
# 0 the original, 1 the calls, 2 (default) both. The same GX state on every draw. A port patch.
